n the battle for Hanzhong when Liu Bei invaded, tasked with guarding the Wei army's granary at Tiandang Mountain. When Zhang He and Xiahou Shang were driven back by Huang Zhong, he provided timely cover. However, underestimating Huang Zhong as merely an old general, he sortied and fell into Fa Zheng's scheme, allowing the granary to be attacked with fire. When he went to fight the fires, he was engaged in combat by Yan Yan and slain.","jp":"魏の将。夏侯惇の甥で、夏侯尚の兄。劉備が漢中に進攻した際に参戦し、天蕩山にある魏の兵糧庫を守備した。張郃と夏侯尚が黄忠に撃退された際には二人を速やかに庇護したが、黄忠を老将と侮って出陣したところ、法正の計略に嵌まって兵糧庫を火攻めされてしまう。消火に向かった際に厳顔と交戦し、討ち取られた。","kr":"위나라의 장수로, 하후돈의 조카이자 하후상의 형이다. 유비가 한중을 침공했을 때 참전하여 천탕산에 위치한 위나라의 군량고를 지켰다. 장합과 하후상이 황충에게 격퇴당하자 두 사람을 거두어 보호했으나, 황충이 노장이라 얕보고 출병했다가 법정의 계책에 빠져 군량고가 화공을 당했다. 불을 끄러 가던 중 엄안과 맞닥뜨려 전사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10392","remark":"","surname":"夏侯","surnameTc":"夏侯","surnameEn":"Xiahou","surnameJp":"夏侯","surnameKr":"하후","surnameOther":"","name":"德","nameTc":"德","nameEn":"De","nameJp":"徳","nameKr":"덕","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"夏侯德","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"197","city":"CS1023","gender":"0","rule":"69","force":"73","wise":"32","politics":"40","charm":"43","will":"36","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"2","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"3","willTalent":"2","weaponMaster":"30/30/73/30/30/10/50/30","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012005","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4700","battleSoulPoint":"5300","debateSoulPoint":"1000","strategy":"","strategy2":"1010301","professions":"0/1/3/0/0/0/2/0/0/0/2/2/1/0/3/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":